    <summary>Modern Chess Information Database (Scid vs. PC Rewrite)</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
NewScid is a fresh, database-compatible rewrite of Scid vs. PC featuring a modern,
intuitive user interface built with Wails v2 (Go backend) and Vue 3 (TypeScript + Vite).

Key Highlights:
- Full SCID Database Compatibility: Native binary support for .si4, .sn4, and .sg4 databases
- Modern Vue 3 Interface: Interactive chessboard with legal move hints, scorebook notation, and replay controls
- Opening Tree Explorer: Dynamically calculates move statistics, frequencies, and candidate scores
- Real-Time UCI Engine Analysis: Live communication with UCI chess engines, eval bar, and PV lines
- Repertoire Trainer & Tactics Rush: Spaced-repetition opening study and tactical puzzle challenges
- Customizable Themes: 17 vector piece sets and 12 board color themes
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/christopherpatrickfair/newscid/releases</releaseNotes>
